# Reconnecting (/conn, or the menu item later): a quit while the network
# is still wanted online dials again as soon as the quit is done, with no
# backoff.
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.test 001 textual :Welcome
! disconnect Reconnecting
> QUIT Reconnecting
! connect
? quitting
< ERROR :Closing Link: textual (Quit: Reconnecting)
> hangup #1
> dial #2 irc.test:6667 plain
? notice Disconnected: quit
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
? failures 0
? connecting
